    "Condition : 1 - \r\nThe London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 1 May 2008 the retention of a bungalow at 190b Wood Lane was not lawful within the meaning of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended by the Planning and Compensation Act 1991) for the following reason:\r\nA Certificate of Lawfulness cannot be granted because the unauthorised construction of the bungalow from an outbuilding at 190b Wood Lane is subject to an Enforcement Notice and is contrary to Section 191(2)(b) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990.\r\n\r\n\r\n"
